  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE\n     - CVE-2018-1000500: missing TLS certificate verification in\n       spawn_https_helper_openssl()\n     - CVE-2021-42383: use-after-free in evaluate() on field concatenation\n     - CVE-2022-28391: terminal escape injection in sockaddr2str() and\n       nslookup parse_reply()\n     - CVE-2023-39810: directory traversal in data_extract_all()\n   * debian/config/pkg/{deb,static,udeb}: FEATURE_PATH_TRAVERSAL_PROTECTION=y,\n     the CVE-2023-39810 guard is compiled out without it\n   * debian/testsuite-linux.diff: disable the cpio uid/gid test, it is\n     environment dependent and fails the same way on an unpatched tree",
